1. Q & A

Q: Why haven't I seen any release?
A: Because our project requires the master to only have code
   in the document development branch, please go to the develop
   branch to view each release.
   You can also search for the corresponding branch `release/...`
   by querying it.

   e.g. branch: release/v0.0.1-pre+1
        tag(in develop branch): v0.0.1-pre+1

Q: How to determine the integrity of the current project?
A: You can try to do it on the release branch that `make`
   to verify the integrity.
   You can still operate on the developing branch, but
   there is a risk involved.
